IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pcla-rules`

-- Independent tests, from independent-expectations.md. Fields in order:
-- court, on appeal from State SC non-federal, involved Constitution/Cth law/instrument,
-- proceeding began before the Act commenced.

-- 1 s 3(1)(a)+(b) met, after commencement
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act does not bar it`
-- 2 involved the Constitution
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
-- 3 involved a Commonwealth Act (same input as 2 in this model)
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
-- 4 involved only a regulation under a Cth Act (same input)
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
-- 5 original jurisdiction, no federal law
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
-- 6 appeal from State SC in federal jurisdiction (limb (a) false)
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
-- 7 s 3(2): pre-commencement saves even a federal-law, original-jurisdiction matter
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS `this Act does not bar it`
-- 8 s 4: Federal court, pre-commencement — no saving
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `another federal court`, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
-- 9 s 4: Territory Supreme Court
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the Supreme Court of a Territory`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
-- 9b Territory Supreme Court, pre-commencement — still barred
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the Supreme Court of a Territory`, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
-- 10 another court: my reading — the Act does not bar it
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `another court`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act does not bar it`
-- 11 federal court with favourable HC-only facts
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `another federal court`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
